Phwwww...Well, it has been a VERY long three weeks...An hour here, five there
and today is the final result.  +1 Stormy, +0 Trollsbane, +0 Excal, a couple
of wands with 0 or -1 charges...I cut it real close with them.  Gray dragon
scale mail, shield of reflection, cloak of protection, gauntlets of dex.  All
of which were +0. :(  I did not know what a wand was...so I zapped myself.  It
turned out to be cancellation.  My AC dropped (Raised?) by 20.  I was really
unhappy about that.  Armed with my trusty potion of pyralysis, I ventured
down to level 50....Went all the way back up to one (To map out my escape), 
and realized at about level 6 that I was no longer teleporting.  (The
intrinsic was no longer there)  SO....I had to find a level teleporter, and a 
ring of teleport control.  Once I had both, back I go to do some shopping 
for amulets.  I get to level 40 (Where he was), and I made a path with my
trusty pickaxe to his room.  I had a nice little path there, but there was
a gem in the way.."I'll just kick this out of my way..." *Kick*  "I'll get 
you my pretty..."  Shit I woke him up!  Now I have to fight before I was ready.
I manage to beat him up(Four times!), and get the amulet, then I went for the 
stairs.  I missed him 12 times with the potion!  "Screw this!"  So I kill him
again, and climb up to level 39.  Before I can get to the stairs(With out tele-
port, I can't get there all that quick)he arrives again.  I keep the amulet 
this time, and manage to get to the stairs before he kills me (again).  Two
amulets of Life saving, and a LOT of attempts I finaly hit him with the potion.
DRAT I'm frozen also...CTRL C,---Do you wish to quit? n , , Phew...it let me
go.  <, and I am at the next level....I went up to the castle level, and tried
to don my trusty ring of levatation...I can't remove my gloves.  I pray...
My god is not happy with me...Good by level 27.  I have a wand of cold...Let's
make a moat!  So I manage to get all the way around the castle on one wand.
Climb all the way up to level 1, and with my trusty ring of conflict I easily
beat the endlevel.  I get up to my alter...#offer i ....there is a thunderclap
in the background...DRAT wrong one... #offer u I get the bright light message
and I win.  With a Samuri, and crap for stuff...three weeks out of my already
busy life....and I win.  It's been worth it.

Advise to newbies...Hack well. ;)....And read the Spoiler file. :]





